OL,3,ATemperatures to hit 25C in burst of
OL,4,Alate September warmth
OL,5,
OL,6,FTemperatures could reach as high as 25C
OL,7,Fin parts of the UK on Tuesday in a
OL,8,Fburst of late September warmth.
OL,10,FThe warmest locations will be across
OL,11,Fthe south-east of England, though
OL,12,Ftemperatures will widely reach into the
OL,13,F20s Celsius across England and the high
OL,14,Fteens elsewhere.
OL,16,FThis will be around 3 to 6 degrees
OL,17,Fabove the average for the time of year.
OL,19,FTuesday night will also be unusually
OL,20,Fwarm with the temperature in some
OL,21,Flocations not falling much below 20C.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
